{"id":"897b4cde94bb1c9e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-topo8-topological-sum.md","title":"ZFC Topo8 Topological Sum","display":"df-zfc-topo8-topological-sum — ZFC Topo8 Topological Sum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo8-topological-sum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo8-topological-sum"],"display":"df-zfc-topo8-topological-sum — ZFC Topo8 Topological Sum","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo8-topological-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo8-topological-sum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo8-topological-sum — ZFC Topo8 Topological Sum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95da8ae9319c9fda\" href=\"?note=95da8ae9319c9fda\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier\">58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,I,\\mathcal X,\\Theta,\\tau\\in V\">\\(S,I,\\mathcal X,\\Theta,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（参数顺序为函数图、定义域、陪域，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11TopologicalSumCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11TopologicalSumCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"95da8ae9319c9fda\" href=\"?note=95da8ae9319c9fda\" title=\"58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier\">58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8TopologicalSum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8TopologicalSum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}topological\\text{-}sum} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8TopologicalSum}_S(S,\\tau,I,\\mathcal X,\\Theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B_\\Theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,I,B_\\Theta)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11TopologicalSumCarrier}_S(S,I,\\mathcal X)\n\\land \\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal X(i),\\Theta(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9.5em}\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq S:\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\{x\\in\\mathcal X(i):\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in U\\}\\in\\Theta(i))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}topological\\text{-}sum} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8TopologicalSum}_S(S,\\tau,I,\\mathcal X,\\Theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B_\\Theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,I,B_\\Theta)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11TopologicalSumCarrier}_S(S,I,\\mathcal X)\n\\land \\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal X(i),\\Theta(i))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9.5em}\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq S:\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\{x\\in\\mathcal X(i):\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in U\\}\\in\\Theta(i))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The existential set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_\\Theta\">\\(B_\\Theta\\)</span> gives the topology-indexing graph a genuine set codomain; the carrier predicate supplies the corresponding function condition for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X\">\\(\\mathcal X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier","status":"resolved","id":"95da8ae9319c9fda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$（参数顺序为函数图、定义域、陪域，see [[58-df-function]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier","status":"resolved","id":"95da8ae9319c9fda","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11TopologicalSumCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-topo11-topological-sum-carrier]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,I,\\mathcal X,\\Theta,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11TopologicalSumCarrier}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8TopologicalSum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo8\\text{-}topological\\text{-}sum} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo8TopologicalSum}_S(S,\\tau,I,\\mathcal X,\\Theta)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B_\\Theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,I,B_\\Theta)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11TopologicalSumCarrier}_S(S,I,\\mathcal X)\n\\land \\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal X(i),\\Theta(i))\\\\\n&\\hspace{9.5em}\\land\n\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq S:\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\{x\\in\\mathcal X(i):\\langle i,x\\rangle\\in U\\}\\in\\Theta(i))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B_\\Theta","display":